DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aaddvv and aaddww drivers support most AdvanSys PCI SCSI host adapters, as
     shown in this table:

           aaddvv             aaddww
           ABP-920         ABP-940UW
           ABP-930 (1)     ABP-940UWD
           ABP-930U        ABP-970UW
           ABP-930UA       ASB-3940UW-00
           ABP-940         ASB-3940U2W-00
           ABP-940U        ASB-3950U160
           ABP-940UA
           ABP-950
           ABP-960 (2)
           ABP-960U (2)
           ABP-970
           ABP-970U
           ABP-980
           ABP-980U

     1.   This board has been sold by SIIG as the Fast SCSI Pro PCI.
     2.   This board has been sold by Iomega as a Jaz Jet PCI adapter.

     The aaddww driver will log some host adapter errors with general messages
     such as

           adw0:0:0: host adapter error 0x12. See adw(4).
           adw0:0:0: host adapter error 0x12, resetting bus. See adw(4).

